    "summary": "The Riptide Battlesuit can use Nova Charge once per battle as its unit is chosen to shoot in its own **[Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase)**. Pick a ranged weapon on the model and give it **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)** until that phase ends. Both Ion accelerator profiles have range 72\", attacks 6 and BS 4+. Use Strength 9, AP −2, damage 3 for Ion accelerator – standard, or Strength 10, AP −3, damage 4 and **[[HAZARDOUS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/hazardous)** for Ion accelerator – supercharge.",
